<title>MEXICO: Deere to buy shares of Mexican subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Deere to buy shares of Mexican subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deere &amp; Company will buy up to 670,636 shares of its Mexican unit John Deere SA de CV at a price of 16.60 pesos per share, the Mexican stock exchange said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The share purchases will take place between Monday and Wednesday next week through the Invermexico brokerage.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of agricultural equipment wants to buy 670,192 A shares and 444 B shares, after which time the National Bank and Securities Commission (CNByV) will seek to delist John Deere in Mexico, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>--Cecilia Cardenas, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728 9552</p>
